{"overview":"هادوتا، یک آدم‌دست ۴۰ ساله، مکان مخفی هنرمند بین‌المللی‌ای که ربوده است را به یاد نمی‌آورد؛ برای بازیابی این اطلاعات گمشده به هیپنوتراپی روی می‌آورد. اما برای بازگرداندن حافظه‌اش باید با دشمنان قدیمی، رویدادهای گذشته و مهم‌تر از همه… خودش روبرو شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Hadoota, a 40-year-old thug, can’t remember the hiding place of an International artist he kidnapped. He resorts to hypnotherapy to retrieve this missing information. But in order to restore his memory, he needs to confront old enemies, past events, and most importantly… himself.","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["مازن أشرف"],"crew_en":["Mazen Ashraf"],"countries":["EG","SA"],"cast":[{"name":"أحمد حلمي","role":"Hadoota - حدوتة","photo":"/xVhX7ia3ptI43V65Os90gbfgxAe.jpg","en":"Ahmed Helmy"},{"name":"Amina Khalil","role":"Dr. Hoda - د. هدى","photo":"/eHJBpaypMN52VSIF84r5MgvC0Mr.jpg"},{"name":"ماجد المصري","role":"El Fakharany - الفخراني ( ظهور خاص)","photo":"/hCFDKcAiotPNs5cvlhHXgFS6dX0.jpg","en":"Maged Elmasry"},{"name":"خالد الصاوي","role":"Metwally - متولي ( ظهور خاص)","photo":"/t4Z5PVsbFgN6RsN1bksjDwZlkhc.jpg","en":"Khaled El Sawy"},{"name":"أحمد بسيوني","role":"Sando - ساندو","photo":"/ohVBtC3UFTHmAJAOLPLH1h5vOjn.jpg","en":"Ahmed Basyoni"},{"name":"عمر شريف","role":"Hadoota (Child) - حدوتة ( صبيا)","photo":"/iSiOazDKO0tIChVnn79oJJGYTHp.jpg","en":"Omar Sherif"},{"name":"محمد ممدوح","role":"Hegazy - حجازي ( ضيف شرف)","photo":"/wH6JHGej3ISZr1vQZxOGmlHHErH.jpg","en":"Mohamed Mamdouh"},{"name":"Rahma Ahmed Farag","role":"Amany - أماني","photo":"/fGXxmZ2BVf2B6nbBAurJCaalCRU.jpg"},{"name":"محمد عبدالعظيم","role":"The Pope - البابا","photo":"/p2IFBCAyvCeR4B0S7UXjgq2huo8.jpg","en":"Mohamed Abd El Azim"},{"name":"خالد جواد","role":"Kowarshi - كوارشي","photo":"/eGG6V6Mkd1vVY7vA2yPLgYQcoJ5.jpg","en":"Khaled Gawad"},{"name":"حمدي هيكل","role":"Metwally's Assistant - مساعد متولي","photo":"/ueZ0le6iIIKhsAAzh0OEWpK1CGp.jpg","en":"Hamdi Hei